  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #6384-B, eff 11-26-96; amd by #7207-B, eff 2-26-00; amd by #7208, eff 2-26-00; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; amd by #7578, eff 10-13-01; amd by #8714, INTERIM, eff 9-5-06, EXPIRED: 3-4-07; amd by #8790, eff 1-5-07; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; amd by #10739, eff 12-2-14; ss by #12346, eff 8-14-17; amd by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #13406, eff 7-23-22; ss by #14279, eff 8-1-25; ss by #14524, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
